===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*dʰewh₂-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|deie}}, from {{inh|en|ang|dēah}}, {{m|ang|dēag||color, hue, dye}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*daugu||colour, shade}}, from {{m|gmw-pro|*daugan||to conceal, be dark}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*dʰewh₂-||to smoke, raise dust, camouflage}}.
{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|goh|tougan||dark, secretive}}, {{m|goh|tougal||dark, hidden, covert}}, {{cog|ang|dēagol}}, {{m|ang|dīegle||dark, hidden, secret}}, {{cog|ang|dohs}}, {{m|ang|dox||dusky, dark}}. See {{l|en|dusk}}.
{{col-bottom}}

